    "section": "General Chemistry",
    "chapter": "Clinical Chemistry",
    "question": "A 25-year-old man became nauseated and vomited 90 minutes after receiving a standard 75 g carbohydrate dose for an oral glucose tolerance test. The best course of action is to:",
